    "status": "live",
    "notes": "San Francisco's jazz station (playtest 4, P4-17: the maintainer's favourite was \"the more complex SF music\", and \"feel free to make more for all regions\"). A swinging combo at 136-176 bpm: a ride cymbal's swing, a walking bass with chromatic approaches, an electric piano comping rootless voicings, and a muted horn playing a head over ii-V changes, then a bebop solo (src/audio/radio-compose-extra.ts, preset jazz-band). The names keep the city's startup satire (a down round, a cap table, a term sheet). Melodies are generated from each track's seed, so they are original. Cut a track by setting its status to vetoed.",
